<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <title>GovTech Readiness Report - <%= client.business_name %></title>
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;
      background: #ffffff;
      color: #1e293b;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 40px;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }
    .report-header {
      border-bottom: 3px solid #0284c7;
      padding-bottom: 20px;
      margin-bottom: 30px;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: flex-end;
    }
    .brand {
      font-size: 24px;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: #0f172a;
    }
    .badge-report {
      background: #e0f2fe;
      color: #0369a1;
      padding: 4px 10px;
      border-radius: 4px;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 700;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }
    .score-banner {
      background: #f8fafc;
      border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 24px;
      margin-bottom: 30px;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-around;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .score-val {
      font-size: 36px;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: #0284c7;
    }
    .score-label {
      font-size: 13px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: #64748b;
      font-weight: 600;
    }
    h2 {
      color: #0f172a;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
      padding-bottom: 8px;
      margin-top: 32px;
    }
    table {
      width: 100%;
      border-collapse: collapse;
      margin: 16px 0;
    }
    th, td {
      padding: 10px;
      border: 1px solid #cbd5e1;
      text-align: left;
      font-size: 14px;
    }
    th {
      background: #f1f5f9;
      font-weight: 700;
    }
    .action-item {
      background: #fefce8;
      border-left: 4px solid #eab308;
      padding: 12px 16px;
      margin: 8px 0;
      font-size: 14px;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="report-header">
    <div>
      <div class="brand">J.E. ROCKER &bull; GOVTECH ADVISORY</div>
      <div style="font-size: 13px; color: #64748b; margin-top: 4px;">Delivered under GovTech Readiness Package ($499)</div>
    </div>
    <div>
      <span class="badge-report">Official Audit Deliverable</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <h1>Federal Contracting Readiness Report</h1>
  <p><strong>Client Entity:</strong> <%= client.business_name %> &bull; <strong>Owner:</strong> <%= client.owner_name %></p>
  <p><strong>Audit Date:</strong> <%= new Date().toLocaleDateString('en-US', { month: 'long', day: 'numeric', year: 'numeric' }) %></p>

  <div class="score-banner">
    <div>
      <div class="score-val"><%= readiness_score || 85 %>/100</div>
      <div class="score-label">Readiness Index</div>
    </div>
    <div>
      <div class="score-val"><%= client.sam_status === 'active' ? 'VERIFIED' : 'PENDING' %></div>
      <div class="score-label">SAM.gov Registration</div>
    </div>
    <div>
      <div class="score-val"><%= client.veteran_owned ? 'SDVOSB' : 'COMMERCIAL' %></div>
      <div class="score-label">Set-Aside Classification</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <h2>1. Entity Registration &amp; Identification Audit</h2>
  <table>
    <tr><th>Parameter</th><th>Verified State</th><th>Status</th></tr>
    <tr><td>SAM.gov Unique Entity Identifier (UEI)</td><td><%= client.uei || 'Pending Issuance' %></td><td><%= client.uei ? '✓ Compliant' : '⚠️ Action Required' %></td></tr>
    <tr><td>SAM.gov Registration Status</td><td><%= client.sam_status %></td><td><%= client.sam_status === 'active' ? '✓ Active' : '⚠️ Renewal/Submission Needed' %></td></tr>
    <tr><td>Primary NAICS Taxonomy</td><td><%= (client.naics_codes || []).join(', ') %></td><td>✓ Mapped to Federal Categories</td></tr>
    <tr><td>Target Operating States</td><td><%= (client.target_states || []).join(', ') %></td><td>✓ Synchronized to Scraper Feeds</td></tr>
  </table>

  <h2>2. Gap Analysis &amp; Action Plan</h2>
  <div class="action-item"><strong>Priority 1:</strong> Formalize capability statement with explicit core competencies mapped to primary NAICS <%= (client.naics_codes || [])[0] || '541512' %>.</div>
  <div class="action-item"><strong>Priority 2:</strong> Register in state vendor portals (<%= (client.target_states || ['AZ', 'CA']).slice(0, 3).join(', ') %>) for localized small-business set-aside preference.</div>
  <div class="action-item"><strong>Priority 3:</strong> Configure automated keyword monitors across target federal departments: <%= (client.target_agencies || ['DOD', 'DLA']).join(', ') %>.</div>

  <h2>3. Next Steps</h2>
  <p>Your firm has been onboarded into the J.E. Rocker opportunity surveillance database. To activate continuous daily proposal match alerts, upgrade to the <em>GovTech Intelligence Subscription</em> ($149/mo).</p>

  <p style="margin-top: 40px; font-size: 13px; color: #64748b; border-top: 1px solid #cbd5e1; padding-top: 16px;">
    J.E. Rocker &bull; Commercial Procurement Advisory &bull; 480-414-9915 &bull; JEROCKER@outlook.com
  </p>
</body>
</html>
